格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Toward Autonomous Scientific Discovery","id":"gh:1309135706","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"Polaris","slug":"ZJU-REAL/Polaris","topics":["ai-agents","ai-scientist","auto-research","dsh-plugin","polaris-agent"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Toward Autonomous Scientific Discovery"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Autonomous, end-to-end AI research: from literature to a reviewed paper."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Powered by a long-running agent core that plans, executes, and self-verifies its own work, turning e"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"very task into a resumable, auditable, human-gated run."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Polaris runs the entire research lifecycle in one desktop app: literature survey, idea generation,\ni"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"dea review, experiment building on real GPU servers, LaTeX paper writing, and paper review. It is\nbu"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ilt for one researcher on their own computer — everything runs locally, with no server to set up —\na"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"nd it treats every long task as a **Voyage**: a persisted, resumable, human-gated agent run that can"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"\nspan hours or days without losing state."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> [!NOTE]\n> Polaris is not a chatbot wrapper. The heavy lifting (crawling, parsing, deduplication, m"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"etric parsing,\n> citation matching) is deterministic code. LLMs are reserved for the judgement calls"},{"id":"p6s3","text":": scoring,\n> synthesis, drafting, and review. This split keeps runs cheap, reproducible, and auditab"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"coring,\n> synthesis, drafting, and review. This split keeps runs cheap, reproducible, and auditable."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Demo"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"A 2-minute tour of the platform: the six-stage pipeline, the Voyage agent core, a real experiment\nru"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"n, and PolarisBuddy."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/388972c1-7ffa-45f2-94c4-07f388379ba2"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Try it live"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"A guest account on an older, frozen web instance, for looking around (new releases are desktop-only)"},{"id":"p11s2","text":":\nsign in at\n<http://101.37.174.109:8080> with the username `guest` and the password `zjuguest123`."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**The account is for demonstration only: it is read-only and cannot call any model.** It reaches eve"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ry\nscreen, the admin views included, but nothing it does changes state — creating, editing, deleting"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" and\nuploading are all refused, and no LLM call will run, whether from chat, compilation or the assi"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"stant.\nIt is there to show what the platform looks like, not to do work on it."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## The research pipeline"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Polaris models research as six stages. Each stage produces durable artifacts that the next stage\ncon"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"sumes, and every hand-off can pause at a human approval gate."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Stage | What Polaris actually does |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| **Literature** | The Research Wiki ingests papers from OpenAlex, Semantic Scholar, and arXiv. Cold"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" start snowballs citations from anchor papers and scores relevance against the **direction library's"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"** inclusion config — statement, goals, scope and exclusions, written through a structured AI interv"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"iew — then extracts full text (PyMuPDF) and compiles a cross-linked wiki page (TL;DR, method, reusab"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"le ideas, concept backlinks). There is **one wiki per paper, shared platform-wide**: the compile pro"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"mpt carries no library statement or rubric, so the same paper never reads differently depending on w"},{"id":"p17s7","text":"here you opened it, and a concept is promoted only once two papers cite it. New arXiv work arrives t"},{"id":"p17s8","text":"hrough the daily feed, the single entry point libraries sync from; incremental sync with watermark r"},{"id":"p17s9","text":"esume, research digests, and Obsidian vault sync. |\n| **Idea** | Idea Forge runs multi-signal gap an"},{"id":"p17s10","text":"alysis over the knowledge base (concept co-occurrence holes, extracted paper limitations, trend velo"},{"id":"p17s11","text":"city, survey gaps) to drive retrieval-planned idea generation. Ideas are scored on four axes (novelt"},{"id":"p17s12","text":"y, feasibility, operability, impact), deduplicated semantically, and funneled to a candidate pool. A"},{"id":"p17s13","text":" deep Research Proposal builder then hardens the winner with a plan-execute-verify loop. |\n| **Idea "},{"id":"p17s14","text":"Review** | Configurable-persona reviewer agents debate pairwise; a judge produces an Elo tournament "},{"id":"p17s15","text":"ranking. Lab members join the discussion live over WebSocket, and their comments enter the agent con"},{"id":"p17s16","text":"text as first-class input. |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## The Voyage agent core"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Research tasks are long-running by nature: a cold-start literature backfill takes hours, an experime"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"nt\nruns for days. Polaris's central abstraction is that every complex task is a Voyage: a resumable,"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"\nauditable run driven by a persisted three-part loop."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Component | Role |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| **Navigator** | Planning. Decomposes a goal into a step plan with sub-goals, dependencies, and bud"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"get. In loop mode it edits the plan incrementally as evidence arrives, rather than replanning from s"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"cratch. |\n| **Helm** | Execution. Runs a single step (LLM calls, tool calls, SSH remote ops, literat"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"ure-API queries) and returns an observation. |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Key features"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- **Research Wiki, \"compile, don't retrieve.\"** LLMs read papers and compile a persistent, cross-lin"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ked\nknowledge base up front, instead of doing on-demand RAG at query time. One wiki per paper, share"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"d\nplatform-wide. Research digests, and Obsidian vault sync with `[[wikilinks]]` and frontmatter.\n- *"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"*One content pool, four collections.** Every paper is stored exactly once; direction libraries,\ntopi"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"c shelves, personal libraries, and the daily feed are membership layers over that pool. Libraries\nar"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"e decoupled from topics (many-to-many), own their own inclusion config, and come with governance:\ncu"},{"id":"p23s7","text":"rators, monthly budgets, duplicate merge, user-created libraries under admin approval, and a\nrecycle"},{"id":"p23s8","text":" bin that stays out of search.\n- **Daily arXiv feed.** A feed of each day's new papers, with likes a"},{"id":"p23s9","text":"nd one-click collection\ninto any of your libraries. It is also the single arXiv entry point: librari"},{"id":"p23s10","text":"es sync from the\npool instead of querying arXiv themselves, on an admin-configurable schedule.\n- **I"},{"id":"p23s11","text":"dea Forge.** Signal-driven gap analysis, four-axis scoring, semantic dedup, and a deep\nResearch-Prop"},{"id":"p23s12","text":"osal builder with novelty double-checking against the library and external sources.\n- **Multi-agent "},{"id":"p23s13","text":"and human review.** Persona reviewer agents debate to an Elo ranking; humans join live\nand are injec"},{"id":"p23s14","text":"ted into the agent context, not bolted on afterward.\n- **Experiment Lab over SSH.** Agents write and"},{"id":"p23s15","text":" run code on real GPU servers, iterate on metrics, and\ncollect logs and figures, under gated remote "},{"id":"p23s16","text":"writes, command allow/deny lists, full audit, and triple\nbudget caps (total, per-run, concurrency). "},{"id":"p23s17","text":"A run keeps a file-based memory across steps, repairs\nitself under a time budget, and pauses to **as"},{"id":"p23s18","text":"k you a question** rather than dying; its console shows\na task map and a terminal you can talk to wh"},{"id":"p23s19","text":"ile it runs.\n- **Paper Writer.** Online multi-file LaTeX with collaborative CRDT editing and local t"},{"id":"p23s20","text":"ectonic\ncompilation; agent drafting bound to real metrics and real citations, plus one-click referen"},{"id":"p23s21","text":"ce\nrefresh wired into the main TeX file.\n- **Paper Review with citation verification.** Existence an"},{"id":"p23s22","text":"d support are checked per citation against the\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

